[{"id":"code-001","answer":"```python\ndef shelf_label(n: int) -> str:\n    return f\"S-{n:04d}\"\n```"},{"id":"code-002","answer":"```python\ndef count_vowel_runs(s: str) -> int:\n    vowels = set(\"aeiou\")\n    count = 0\n    in_run = False\n    for char in s:\n        if char in vowels:\n            if not in_run:\n                count += 1\n                in_run = True\n        else:\n            in_run = False\n    return count\n```"},{"id":"code-003","answer":"```python\ndef merge_slots(slots: list[list[int]]) -> list[list[int]]:\n    if not slots:\n        return []\n    sorted_slots = sorted(slots)\n    merged = [sorted_slots[0][:]]\n    for start, end in sorted_slots[1:]:\n        if start <= merged[-1][1]:\n            merged[-1][1] = max(merged[-1][1], end)\n        else:\n            merged.append([start, end])\n    return merged\n```"},{"id":"code-004","answer":"```python\ndef tally_votes(votes: list[str]) -> list[str]:\n    counts = {}\n    first_seen = {}\n    for index, candidate in enumerate(votes):\n        counts[candidate] = counts.get(candidate, 0) + 1\n        first_seen.setdefault(candidate, index)\n    return sorted(counts, key=lambda candidate: (-counts[candidate], first_seen[candidate]))\n```"},{"id":"code-005","answer":"```python\ndef stair_ways(n: int, broken: list[int]) -> int:\n    mod = 1_000_000_007\n    broken_set = set(broken)\n    ways = [0] * (n + 1)\n    ways[0] = 1\n    for step in range(1, n + 1):\n        if step not in broken_set:\n            ways[step] = (ways[step - 1] + (ways[step - 2] if step >= 2 else 0)) % mod\n    return ways[n]\n```"},{"id":"code-006","answer":"```python\ndef rle_decode(s: str) -> str:\n    result = []\n    count = \"\"\n    for char in s:\n        if char.isdigit():\n            count += char\n        else:\n            result.append(char * (int(count) if count else 1))\n            count = \"\"\n    return \"\".join(result)\n```"},{"id":"code-007","answer":"```python\ndef grid_islands(grid: list[str]) -> list[int]:\n    if not grid:\n        return []\n    rows, cols = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n    visited = set()\n    areas = []\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] != \"#\" or (r, c) in visited:\n                continue\n            stack = [(r, c)]\n            visited.add((r, c))\n            area = 0\n            while stack:\n                cr, cc = stack.pop()\n                area += 1\n                for nr, nc in ((cr - 1, cc), (cr + 1, cc), (cr, cc - 1), (cr, cc + 1)):\n                    if 0 <= nr < rows and 0 <= nc < cols and grid[nr][nc] == \"#\" and (nr, nc) not in visited:\n                        visited.add((nr, nc))\n                        stack.append((nr, nc))\n            areas.append(area)\n    return sorted(areas, reverse=True)\n```"},{"id":"code-008","answer":"```python\ndef next_bus(times: list[str], now: str) -> str:\n    return min(times, key=lambda time: (time < now, time))\n```"},{"id":"code-009","answer":"```python\ndef bracket_depth(s: str) -> int:\n    opening = \"([{\"\n    closing = \")]}\"\n    pairs = dict(zip(closing, opening))\n    stack = []\n    max_depth = 0\n    for char in s:\n        if char in opening:\n            stack.append(char)\n            max_depth = max(max_depth, len(stack))\n        elif char in closing:\n            if not stack or stack.pop() != pairs[char]:\n                return -1\n    return max_depth if not stack else -1\n```"},{"id":"code-010","answer":"```python\ndef split_bill(total: int, weights: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    weight_sum = sum(weights)\n    shares = [(total * weight) // weight_sum for weight in weights]\n    remainders = [(total * weight) % weight_sum for weight in weights]\n    leftover = total - sum(shares)\n    for index in sorted(range(len(weights)), key=lambda i: (-remainders[i], i))[:leftover]:\n        shares[index] += 1\n    return shares\n```"},{"id":"instruction-001","answer":"・蝉の声が青空に響く。\n・夕立のあと、風が涼しい。\n・海辺に夏の陽が沈む。"},{"id":"instruction-002","answer":"{\"name\":\"森川あおい\",\"age\":34}"},{"id":"instruction-003","answer":"はい"},{"id":"instruction-004","answer":"桜は春に美しい花を咲かせます。"},{"id":"instruction-005","answer":"秋は木々が色づき、空気が澄む季節だ。"},{"id":"instruction-006","answer":"GOOD MORNING"},{"id":"instruction-007","answer":"いちご、みかん、りんご"},{"id":"instruction-008","answer":"二千二十六"},{"id":"instruction-009","answer":"今日は穏やかに晴れています。過ごしやすい陽気です。以上。"},{"id":"instruction-010","answer":"```python\nprint(1 + 1)\n```"},{"id":"japanese-001","answer":"部長が明日の会議でそうおっしゃった。"},{"id":"japanese-002","answer":"明日、御社に伺います。"},{"id":"japanese-003","answer":"黒い目をした、きれいな女の子。\n目がきれいな、黒い女の子。"},{"id":"japanese-004","answer":"非常に忙しく、誰の手でも借りたいほど余裕がない状態を表す。"},{"id":"japanese-005","answer":"「挽回」は失ったものを取り戻す意味なので、「汚名挽回」では汚名を取り戻すことになり、誤用とされる。「汚名返上」または「名誉挽回」が本来の言い方である。"},{"id":"japanese-006","answer":"「象は」は話題を示し、「鼻が」は述語「長い」の主語を示す。"},{"id":"japanese-007","answer":"ちょうふく、じゅうふく"},{"id":"japanese-008","answer":"図書館は夜8時まで開館し、休館日を火曜に移す。"},{"id":"japanese-009","answer":"場面1は断り、場面2は承諾。"},{"id":"japanese-010","answer":"今朝は少し寒かった。駅まで歩く途中で、川沿いの桜がもう咲き始めているのに気づいた。春はすぐそこまで来ているようである。"},{"id":"knowledge-000","answer":"分からない"},{"id":"knowledge-001","answer":"Sora"},{"id":"knowledge-002","answer":"ジェフリー・ヒントン"},{"id":"knowledge-003","answer":"Nintendo Switch 2"},{"id":"knowledge-004","answer":"分からない"},{"id":"knowledge-005","answer":"分からない"},{"id":"knowledge-006","answer":"分からない"},{"id":"knowledge-007","answer":"分からない"},{"id":"knowledge-008","answer":"琵琶湖"},{"id":"knowledge-009","answer":"源頼朝"},{"id":"knowledge-010","answer":"1964"},{"id":"logic-001","answer":"D"},{"id":"logic-002","answer":"Aは嘘つき、Bは正直者。"},{"id":"logic-003","answer":"木曜日"},{"id":"logic-004","answer":"7.5"},{"id":"logic-005","answer":"C"},{"id":"logic-006","answer":"42"},{"id":"logic-007","answer":"いいえ"},{"id":"logic-008","answer":"72"},{"id":"logic-009","answer":"降らなかった"},{"id":"logic-010","answer":"6"},{"id":"math-001","answer":"37"},{"id":"math-002","answer":"108"},{"id":"math